ed. We never have to deal with that. For those guys over there, it's terrifying. It is, and it's a reality of life for them that we don't really have an understanding. You know, for you and I, 9-11 has seared into our minds. Our kids, my oldest barely remembers it. And your girls are too young. I mean, most of my staff",
